    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0380" n="368" xml:id="pg368"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by General Chou
                            En-lai to General Marshall</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 101.2–3</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-01-18">18 January 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Herewith I am submitting for your reference a list showing attacks being made by
                    government troops on Communist-led troops and areas between 10 and 13
                    January:</p>
                <p>[Here follows list of thirteen incidents.]</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chou En-lai</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
